rformance-first component library</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card-content\">\n          <p class=\"text-muted-foreground\" style=\"font-size: 0.875rem\"\n            >Zero JavaScript for static components. Interaction JS only where HTML and CSS can't express it.</p\n          >\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"3 of 3\" style=\"flex: 0 0 100%\">\n      <div class=\"card w-full\">\n        <div class=\"card-header\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-title\">Project Gamma</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-description\">Accessible by default</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card-content\">\n          <p class=\"text-muted-foreground\" style=\"font-size: 0.875rem\"\n            >WAI-ARIA patterns, keyboard navigation, reduced motion, high contrast - all built in.</p\n          >\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button class=\"carousel-prev\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\">\n    <i data-lucide=\"chevron-left\"></i>\n  </button>\n  <button class=\"carousel-next\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">\n    <i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\"></i>\n  </button>\n  <div class=\"carousel-dots\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose slide to display\"></div>\n</div>\n","individual":true}]
